<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Terms & Conditions - Rahma Pearl</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
        .terms-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 50px auto; background: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .terms-header { border-bottom: 2px solid #6c5ce7; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #6c5ce7; }
        h5 { color: #2d3436; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 25px; }
        p, li { color: #636e72; line-height: 1.6; }
        .btn-back { background-color: #6c5ce7; color: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 25px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; }
        .btn-back:hover { background-color: #5b4bc4; color: white; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="terms-container">
        <div class="terms-header">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-file-contract me-2"></i>Terms & Conditions</h2>
            <p>Last Updated: March 2026</p>
        </div>

        <h5>1. Admission Policy</h5>
        <p>Admission is granted solely at the discretion of the management. Residents must provide valid government ID (Aadhar/Passport) and college/work proof at the time of check-in.</p>

        <h5>2. Monthly Rent & Security Deposit</h5>
        <ul>
            <li>The monthly rent is <strong>₹5,500</strong> as specified in the system.</li>
            <li>Rent must be paid via the student dashboard by the 5th of every month.</li>
            <li>A security deposit (refundable) is required at the time of joining.</li>
        </ul>

        <h5>3. Safety & Security</h5>
        <p>For the safety of all residents, the PG gate closes at 10:00 PM. Residents requiring late entry must obtain prior permission via the "Request Letter" section in the dashboard.</p>

        <h5>4. Code of Conduct</h5>
        <ul>
            <li>Maintaining cleanliness in rooms and common areas is mandatory.</li>
            <li>No outside guests are allowed in the rooms without management approval.</li>
            <li>Any damage to PG property will be charged to the resident responsible.</li>
        </ul>

        <h5>5. Termination of Residency</h5>
        <p>Residents wishing to vacate must provide a 30-day notice period. Failure to do so may result in the forfeiture of the security deposit.</p>

        <div class="text-center">
            <a href="/register" class="btn-back">Return to Registration</a>
            <br>
            <a href="/" class="text-muted small mt-3 d-inline-block text-decoration-none">Back to Homepage</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>